{"id":"661941","name":"番茄煮油面筋塞肉","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661941/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"210克"},{"name":"油面筋","amount":"8个"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄沙司","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：猪肉（已清洗）、油面筋、番茄（已清洗）、番茄沙司。","img":"images/661941/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将猪肉放在案板上切成块。","img":"images/661941/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入绞肉机里，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/661941/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/661941/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/661941/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖、调味搅成肉末。","img":"images/661941/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开盖取出。","img":"images/661941/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/661941/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"随后，将油面筋戳一个洞，把肉末塞进去。","img":"images/661941/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/661941/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将番茄清洗清洗捞出。","img":"images/661941/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放在案板上划个十字刀。","img":"images/661941/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入盆里，用开水泡一会儿，去皮。","img":"images/661941/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放在案板上切成块。","img":"images/661941/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入切好的番茄翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/661941/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"接着，合入油面筋塞肉加适量的清水。","img":"images/661941/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"翻动翻动煮上8到10分钟。","img":"images/661941/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"然后，加适量的番茄沙司。","img":"images/661941/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/661941/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"加适量的零卡糖。","img":"images/661941/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"调味翻匀即成。","img":"images/661941/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}